<p>That sounds really interesting and dynamic. So maybe you'll want to expand on why they cause these earthquakes in some way whether that be a flat out answer, a mostly mysterious hint, or what have you. Given that the foundation commonly works to avoid disasters, they likely wouldn't attempt an all-out war without the certain leverage or answers of some other SCPs at the foundation's disposal. I could absolutely see them preparing repair/response teams to either stop/lessen the quakes and/or repair the damages &amp; people and predictions could actually fit really well with that. The most interesting and probably difficult way would be for the Foundation to establish some form of agreement of peace. Remember: Secure, Contain, Protect. Think about what's going into the procedures portion.</p>

